  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">BPSC Exam Calendar 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-02-03T14:02:15+05:30\">February 3, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:02 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/\">Bihar Public Service Commission BPSC</a>,</strong> As per the latest official update, the <strong>Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</strong> has released the <strong>Exam Calendar for 2025–2026.</strong> It includes the schedule for various recruitment examinations such as Assistant Education Development Officer (AEDO), Assistant Town Planner (ATP) Special School Teacher (Classes 1-5 &amp; Classes 6-8) Assistant Engineer (Civil / Mechanical / Electrical) Block Cooperative Officer Block Minority Welfare Officer Revenue Officer &amp; Equivalent Labor Superintendent Senior Deputy Collector / Sub-Divisional Officer.&nbsp;Candidates planning to appear for these <strong>exams</strong> can now check their exam dates and download their <strong>admit cards.</strong><br>\n</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">BPSC Exam Calendar 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">BPSC Exam Information 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bpsc-exam-calendar-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : January 2026 To June 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Date : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><p><strong>Not Available.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Age Limit Details</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p><strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">Not Available</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">BPSC Exam Information 2025 : Recruitment Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Name</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Conducted By</span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">BPSC Various Posts New Exam Calendar 2026</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bihar Public Service Commission</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080;\">&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download The BPSC Exam Calendar 2026&nbsp;</span></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"216\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"216\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"168\">Visit the Official BPSC Website</strong>:</span><br data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"172\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Go to bpsc.gov.in.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"341\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"341\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"263\">Go to the ‘Examinations’ Section</strong>:</span><br data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"267\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, hover over the <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"320\">“Examinations”</strong> tab in the top menu.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"422\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"422\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"367\">Select ‘Calendar’</strong>:</span><br data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"371\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">From the dropdown menu, click on <strong data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"421\">“Calendar”</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"552\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"552\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"462\">Access the Annual Calendar 2026</strong>:</span><br data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"466\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the Calendar page, find and click on the link titled <strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"551\">“Annual Calendar 2026”</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"675\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"675\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"577\">Download the PDF</strong>:</span><br data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"581\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The BPSC Exam Calendar 2026 PDF will open. You can download or print it for your reference.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Check Revised Exam Calendar</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Examination-Calendar-02.02.2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Exam Calendar</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/BPSC-Calendar-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">BPSC</span> Official Website</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;BPSC Exam Calendar 2026</span> : Important Question&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q1. What is the BPSC Exam Calendar 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><strong>A:</strong> The <strong>BPSC Exam Calendar 2026</strong> provides the schedule of exams conducted by the <strong>(BPSC)</strong> for <strong>various posts</strong>, including application start and end dates, examination dates, and result timelines.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q3. What are the key exams listed in the BPSC Exam Calendar 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><strong>A:</strong> The key exams include:</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q2. Where can I download the BPSC Exam Calendar 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><strong>A:</strong> The BPSC Exam Calendar can be downloaded from the official <strong>BPSC website</strong> at <a target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">ssc.nic.in</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_25611\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-25611\" style=\"width: 1014px\" class=\